      <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: 360, height: 176, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 12, padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 24, borderRadius: 4, background: '#2563EB' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>Phase 0 · 编排内核</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          确定性状态机：Phase / Status 正交、CAS、终态保护
          <br />
          SQLite 仓储 + 追加审计事件，状态与事件同事务
          <br />
          G1/G2/G3 确定性评估器 + LangGraph interrupt 真实中断恢复
          <br />
          RBAC 审批、Capability 交集、澄清 PAUSED_FOR_HUMAN
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 400, top: 196, width: 360, height: 200, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 12, padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
